{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NO5fp1F2zl1795819385.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場關注中東局勢發展，原油期貨價格變動不大。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報83.08美元一桶，跌60美仙，跌幅百分之0.7。倫敦期油收市報95.44美元一桶，跌1.13美元，跌幅百分之1.1。</p><p></p><p>全個星期計，紐約期油跌百分之1，倫敦期油就升百分之3，扭轉過去三星期跌勢，並見本月以來首個星期升幅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.482195+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:55:12.723942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:35.424722+00:00","content_hash":"b0b8cdef85f7240f7675972f04a7e16cee575f58918fd041974d0bea8ab4a371","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.482195+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}